---
/**
 * A visible TODO(esquire) marker for missing business facts.
 * It ONLY shows while running `npm run dev`. On the live site it renders nothing,
 * so placeholders never reach customers. Search the code for "TODO(esquire)" to find them all.
 */
const show = import.meta.env.DEV;
---
{show && <div class="todo">TODO(esquire): <slot /></div>}
